<article class="ltx_document">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">InfiMed-ORBIT: Aligning LLMs on Open-Ended Complex Tasks via Rubric-Based Incremental Training</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Pengkai Wang
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
